# Env — secrets are ignored by default; only key-listing templates are committed.
# A narrow pattern let `.env.stale-local-dev` sit uncommitted-but-committable for
# four months (2026-05-29~09-12) with a worker token in it: `.env.*.local` requires
# the name to END in `.local`, and "local" in the middle looks like it is covered.
# Guard: tests/test_env_files_cannot_be_committed.py
.env
.env.*
!*.example

# Devcontainer worktree overlay (auto-generated)
.devcontainer/docker-compose.override.yml

